{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "short-drama9",
  "title": "影视精修·单镜头",
  "titleEn": "Film · single-shot polish",
  "summary": "分镜→设定→镜头节点→关键帧图片→镜头视频（手动精修）",
  "category": "film",
  "tags": [],
  "version": "1.1.0",
  "author": {
    "name": "AIArtEngine",
    "url": "https://github.com/Justin-sky/ai-art-engine"
  },
  "license": "CC-BY-4.0",
  "cover": "cover.png",
  "requires": {
    "nodeTypes": [
      "asset.image",
      "asset.video",
      "film.shot",
      "film.workbench",
      "note.text",
      "play.script"
    ],
    "appMinVersion": "7.5.0"
  },
  "plan": {
    "title": "影视精修（单镜头工作台）",
    "nodes": [
      {
        "key": "script",
        "typeId": "play.script",
        "title": "剧本",
        "params": {
          "text": "（在此填写剧本 / 故事梗概；也可以先用「剧本生成」节点产出后接入分镜拆解）"
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "workbench",
        "typeId": "film.workbench",
        "title": "影视工作台",
        "params": {
          "filmAspectRatio": "16:9",
          "filmReviewMaxRounds": 1,
          "filmCastKinds": "character,location"
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "shot",
        "typeId": "film.shot",
        "title": "镜头 1",
        "params": {
          "filmShotRef": "1"
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "keyframe",
        "typeId": "asset.image",
        "title": "关键帧",
        "params": {
          "generateAspectRatio": "16:9"
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "clip",
        "typeId": "asset.video",
        "title": "镜头视频",
        "params": {
          "generateAspectRatio": "16:9",
          "generateDuration": 5
        }
      },
      {
        "key": "note",
        "typeId": "note.text",
        "title": "使用说明",
        "params": {
          "text": "在「影视工作台」完成分镜与角色场景设定后，在「镜头」节点里切换镜头序号 / id：它自动输出该镜关键帧提示词（接关键帧图片生成）、出场角色与地点设定图（接参考图口锁一致性）与动态提示词（接视频生成）。复制「镜头 → 关键帧 → 镜头视频」这一组即可并行精修多镜。"
        }
      }
    ],
    "edges": [
      {
        "from": "script",
        "to": "workbench",
        "fromPort": "out",
        "toPort": "in"
      },
      {
        "from": "workbench",
        "to": "shot",
        "fromPort": "out",
        "toPort": "in"
      },
      {
        "from": "workbench",
        "to": "shot",
        "fromPort": "out-cast",
        "toPort": "in-cast"
      },
      {
        "from": "shot",
        "to": "keyframe",
        "fromPort": "out",
        "toPort": "in-text"
      },
      {
        "from": "shot",
        "to": "keyframe",
        "fromPort": "out-refs",
        "toPort": "in-image"
      },
      {
        "from": "keyframe",
        "to": "clip",
        "fromPort": "out",
        "toPort": "in-image"
      },
      {
        "from": "shot",
        "to": "clip",
        "fromPort": "out-motion",
        "toPort": "in-text"
      }
    ]
  }
}
